Horses weep and stall on return --- Sumantra stays days with Guha hoping recall --- Forest trees beasts waters mourn Rāma --- Joyless Ayōdhyā sighs as palace women wail --- Grieving Ayōdhyā seems childless Kausalyā --- Daśaratha confesses hasty woman-driven act --- Daśaratha begs recall for he cannot live --- Daśaratha longs to see Rāma or meet Yama --- Daśaratha cries uncrossable ocean of grief --- Daśaratha faints lamenting as Kausalyā fears